{
    // The grid's effects: the engine's own, but with its exposure metered from the light its sun and sky shed rather
    // than from what the view sees, so a thing looks the same however much of the view something darker or brighter
    // fills as the camera nears it; a haze in the valleys that thins with height (Curves/Haze.curve); and a glow
    // around what is bright (Bloom).
